WEBVTT

NOTE CineReels — prov-dramabox-42000023968 — Episode 5 — English subtitles
NOTE Transcribed 2026-11-27 from the real episode audio (faster-whisper small).

1
00:00:07.600 --> 00:00:11.400
Welcome to my home.

2
00:00:11.400 --> 00:00:12.800
You sure this is your home?

3
00:00:13.600 --> 00:00:15.200
Not a royal broom closet?

4
00:00:15.200 --> 00:00:19.400
I'm broke and exiled.

5
00:00:20.400 --> 00:00:22.200
This is the only place they gave me.

6
00:00:22.200 --> 00:00:23.400
I hope you don't mind.

7
00:00:28.320 --> 00:00:29.720
You saved me from the arena.

8
00:00:30.320 --> 00:00:31.920
Wherever you go, I'll go.

9
00:00:32.520 --> 00:00:33.720
We'll make a life here.

10
00:00:37.540 --> 00:00:38.740
What a kiss-ass.

11
00:00:46.060 --> 00:00:48.860
Sylvia, you've had a long day.

12
00:00:49.060 --> 00:00:51.660
Here, sit down and take a rest.

13
00:00:58.020 --> 00:00:58.620
Sit.

14
00:00:58.620 --> 00:00:59.620
Thanks, Finn.

15
00:01:00.020 --> 00:01:03.220
But you three just spent the whole day surviving in the arena.

16
00:01:03.220 --> 00:01:04.620
You must be exhausted.

17
00:01:05.020 --> 00:01:06.020
Get some rest.

18
00:01:07.020 --> 00:01:08.620
I'll see what I can find for dinner.

19
00:01:11.170 --> 00:01:13.370
Rule number one of handling men,

20
00:01:13.570 --> 00:01:15.970
the way to their hearts is through their stomach.

21
00:01:16.170 --> 00:01:17.970
Once I fill their stomachs,

22
00:01:17.970 --> 00:01:21.370
those affinity points are gonna skyrocket.

23
00:01:31.470 --> 00:01:32.670
Are you kidding me?

24
00:01:33.470 --> 00:01:36.070
Even a rat would starve in this place.

25
00:01:37.070 --> 00:01:40.670
I just made this grand speech about taking care of them.

26
00:01:41.070 --> 00:01:42.070
And now what?

27
00:01:42.070 --> 00:01:43.670
What am I supposed to feed them?

28
00:01:43.670 --> 00:01:44.470
Dust?

29
00:01:44.470 --> 00:01:45.470
Vibes?

30
00:01:45.470 --> 00:01:46.870
Feminine optimism?

31
00:01:59.180 --> 00:02:00.380
Look at those faces.

32
00:02:01.180 --> 00:02:03.580
How am I supposed to tell them my kitchen is empty?

33
00:02:07.800 --> 00:02:08.800
Just wait here.

34
00:02:09.400 --> 00:02:11.200
I'll be right back with a feast.
